    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n91354" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πῡθᾱ-εύς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">έως</span>,
			ὁ, epith. of Apollo at Lindus, <i><span class="en">
			<u>IG</u>
			12(1).820
		</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
			834
		</span></i>; also at Corinth, Sparta, etc., <i><span class="en">
			Paus.
			2.35.2
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			3.10.8
		</span></i>, etc.: hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πῡθᾱ-εῖα</span></b> , and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πυθαῆα</span></b> , τά, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>his festival</i> at Sparta and Megara, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				5(1).659
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				7.48
			</span></i>.</div>
